      "subject": "Língua Portuguesa & Interpretação",
      "examining_board": "INEP",
      "institute": "MEC / ENEM",
      "year": 2022,
      "difficulty": "Médio",
      "statement": "## A Teen’s View of Social Media\nInstagram is made up of all photos and videos. There is the home page that showcases the posts from people you follow, an explore tab which offers posts from accounts all over the world, and your own page, with a notification tab to show who likes and comments on your posts.\nIt has some downsides though. It is known to make many people feel insecure or down about themselves because the platform showcases the highlights of everyone’s lives, while rarely showing the negatives. This can make one feel like their life is not going as well as others, contributing to the growing rates of anxiety or depression in many teens today. There is an underlying desire for acceptance through the number of likes or followers one has.\nO termo “downsides” introduz a ideia de que o Instagram é responsável por",
      "options": "[{\"key\":\"A\",\"text\":\"oferecer recursos de fotografia.\"},{\"key\":\"B\",\"text\":\"divulgar problemas dos usuários.\"},{\"key\":\"C\",\"text\":\"estimular aceitação dos seguidores.\"},{\"key\":\"D\",\"text\":\"provocar ansiedade nos adolescentes.\"},{\"key\":\"E\",\"text\":\"aproximar pessoas ao redor do mundo.\"}]",
      "right_answer": "D",
